                      <b>{p.name}</b>
                      <span class="fine">{platformFile(VERSION, p)}</span>
                    </span>
                    <span class="dls__trust fine">{p.trust}</span>
                    <a class="btn dls__btn" href={assetUrl(VERSION, platformFile(VERSION, p))} download data-dl-link aria-label={`Download v8s for ${p.name}`}>
                      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down" aria-hidden="true" />Download
                    </a>
                  </li>
                ))
              }
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="dls__group">
            <h3 class="dls__hd">CLI: <code>v8s serve</code>, <code>v8s server</code></h3>
            <ul class="dls__list">
              {
